      "url": "http://www.icehousegs.com",
      "title": "Icehouse Tap Room Gulf Shores | bar & grill | 112 Windmill Ridge Rd, Gulf Shores, Alabama, United States",
      "text": "top of pageICEHOUSE TAP ROOM \n\nGULF SHORES, ALABAMAFind us here\n\n \n \n \n \n\n(251) 200-0157Live Music Daily \nKitchen Open Late     Under 21 till 9pmHomeMenusI Dare YouMoreUse tab to navigate through the menu items.\n\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n\nThe only place on the Waterfront where there is an uninterrupted sunset view 365 days a year!!Located on a waterfront near Gulf Shores Beach, we at Icehouse Tap Room have been serving up refreshingly-unique drinks and foods since 2000 in Baton Rouge, LA, and are excited to be opening Icehouse Tap Room in Gulf Shores!  \n\nWe offer a funky indoor space and a beachy outdoor space with an atmosphere that acts as a place for friends, wanderers, and adventurers to share a drink together as equals.  The previous business strived for an extremely local atmosphere and Icehouse Taproom will continue that tradition for the area!   We look forward to making new friends and seeing old friends.  We will have Live Entertainment and exciting Sporting Event watch parties!\n\nWe can't wait to see everyone!AWARD\nWINNING\nBEERSQuench Your Thirst with 24 \n\nLocal & National Beers on Tap!Check out our wicked menu!!To play, press and hold the enter key. To stop, release the enter key.Visitors!!ICEHOUSE TAP ROOM EVENT CALENDARGet in Touch\n112 Windmill Ridge Road, Gulf Shores, Alabama\n\nGM@icehousegs.com  /  Tel. 251-200-0157SubmitThanks for submitting!ICEHOUSE TAP ROOM Visit UsMonday - Sunday: 11am - 2amIcehouse Tap Room Gulf Shoresgm@Icehousegs.com©2024 by Icehouse Tap Room Gulf Shores. bottom of page",
